{"seq":2,"slug":"competitor-price-timeseries","title":"竞品价格时序与趋势","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/price-intelligence-data/competitor-price-timeseries","wordCount":2358,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"竞品价格时序与趋势\">竞品价格时序与趋势</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>竞品的价格史是一条<strong>被采集调度决定采样节奏的、事件驱动的时间序列</strong>。它和你熟悉的监控指标序列有本质差别：监控指标是按固定周期主动上报的，而竞品价格是&quot;我们按自己的计划去问、对方按自己的节奏在改&quot;。结果是采样间隔与价格变化的真实时刻不重合——你可能在对方降价 4 小时后才看到它，也可能在一个价格只维持了 20 分钟的闪促里恰好抓到一次点。</p>\n<p>这个性质决定了三件工程事实。第一，<strong>时间戳要分两种</strong>：<code>observed_at</code>（我们看到的时刻）与 <code>effective_at</code>（价格实际生效的时刻，多数情况下不可知，只能用推断）。第二，<strong>缺失不等于没有变化</strong>：两次采样之间的空白期价格可能改过又改回来，系统不应该把&quot;没采到&quot;当成&quot;没变&quot;。第三，<strong>促销点是事件而非基线</strong>：只有把促销剥离出去，常规价序列才能用于趋势估计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[trusted_price 流] --&gt; B[按 offer 分组排序]&#10;  B --&gt; C[会话化: 连续同价合并为 segment]&#10;  C --&gt; D{segment 类型}&#10;  D --&gt;|稳定段| E[基线序列]&#10;  D --&gt;|短期偏离| F[事件序列 促销/秒杀]&#10;  E --&gt; G[趋势估计: 斜率+变点]&#10;  E --&gt; H[统计量: 分位数/波动率]&#10;  F --&gt; I[价格战信号]&#10;  G --&gt; J[价格位置特征]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[下游: 看板/规则引擎]\">graph TD\n  A[trusted_price 流] --&gt; B[按 offer 分组排序]\n  B --&gt; C[会话化: 连续同价合并为 segment]\n  C --&gt; D{segment 类型}\n  D --&gt;|稳定段| E[基线序列]\n  D --&gt;|短期偏离| F[事件序列 促销/秒杀]\n  E --&gt; G[趋势估计: 斜率+变点]\n  E --&gt; H[统计量: 分位数/波动率]\n  F --&gt; I[价格战信号]\n  G --&gt; J[价格位置特征]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[下游: 看板/规则引擎]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序列概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>误用后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>segment</td>\n<td>连续同价的区间</td>\n<td>压缩数据、识别变更点</td>\n<td>把抖动当改价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基线序列</td>\n<td>剔除促销后的常规价</td>\n<td>趋势、弹性、位置</td>\n<td>趋势被促销拉偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件序列</td>\n<td>短期偏离段</td>\n<td>价格战、促销战信号</td>\n<td>误判为长期降价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样密度</td>\n<td>单位时间有效观测数</td>\n<td>置信度加权</td>\n<td>稀疏段结论不可信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"会话化-把散点压成变更记录\">会话化：把散点压成变更记录</h2><h3 id=\"为什么先会话化\">为什么先会话化</h3><p>原始价格点绝大多数是重复的：商品价格一周不变，你会采到上百个相同值。直接对这些点做统计是浪费，也让&quot;改价&quot;这个事件被淹没。会话化（把连续相同价格合并成一个 <code>segment</code>）是标准做法，pandas 的时间序列文档把这种&quot;按值变化切段&quot;的操作归入分组的常规模式，可用&quot;与前值不同即新组&quot;的累积技巧实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pandas as pd&#10;&#10;def to_segments(df: pd.DataFrame) -&gt; pd.DataFrame:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;df: [offer_id, observed_at, landed_base]，已按 offer 与时间排序&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    df = df.sort_values([&quot;offer_id&quot;, &quot;observed_at&quot;])&#10;    changed = df.groupby(&quot;offer_id&quot;)[&quot;landed_base&quot;].diff().ne(0)&#10;    df[&quot;seg_id&quot;] = changed.groupby(df[&quot;offer_id&quot;]).cumsum()&#10;    seg = df.groupby([&quot;offer_id&quot;, &quot;seg_id&quot;]).agg(&#10;        price_start=(&quot;landed_base&quot;, &quot;first&quot;),&#10;        price_end=(&quot;landed_base&quot;, &quot;last&quot;),&#10;        first_seen=(&quot;observed_at&quot;, &quot;min&quot;),&#10;        last_seen=(&quot;observed_at&quot;, &quot;max&quot;),&#10;        n_obs=(&quot;landed_base&quot;, &quot;size&quot;),&#10;    ).reset_index()&#10;    seg[&quot;duration_s&quot;] = (seg[&quot;last_seen&quot;] - seg[&quot;first_seen&quot;]).dt.total_seconds()&#10;    return seg\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> to_segments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(df: pd.DataFrame) -> pd.DataFrame:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"df: [offer_id, observed_at, landed_base]，已按 offer 与时间排序\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df.sort_values([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"offer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"observed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    changed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df.groupby(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"offer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"landed_base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].diff().ne(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seg_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> changed.groupby(df[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"offer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]).cumsum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df.groupby([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"offer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seg_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]).agg(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        price_start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"landed_base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"first\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        price_end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"landed_base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"last\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        first_seen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"observed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        last_seen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"observed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        n_obs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"landed_base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ).reset_index()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"duration_s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (seg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"last_seen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"first_seen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]).dt.total_seconds()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seg</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>n_obs</code> 与 <code>duration_s</code> 是两个不能省的字段：它们刻画了每个 segment 的<strong>证据强度</strong>。只观察到一次就变的点（<code>n_obs=1</code> 且 <code>duration_s=0</code>）与稳定观测了两天的点，可信度完全不同——前者可能只是采集抖动或短暂闪促。</p>\n<h3 id=\"变更点与浮点陷阱\">变更点与浮点陷阱</h3><p>价格是货币金额，比较时不要用浮点相等。实务做法是换算成最小货币单位（分）以整数比较，或用容差（例如小于 0.01 本币单位视为未变）。这个细节看起来琐碎，但跨境多币种换算引入的舍入误差会让&quot;价格未变&quot;被误判成每小时都在微调，进而制造大量假的变更事件，把下游的异常检测和告警淹没。</p>\n<h2 id=\"趋势估计\">趋势估计</h2><h3 id=\"在不均匀采样下的斜率\">在不均匀采样下的斜率</h3><p>采样间隔不均匀时，普通最小二乘对时间回归仍然无偏（只要采样时刻与价格无关），但<strong>样本量的时间分布会影响残差方差</strong>，因此应当加权。若关心的是&quot;过去 30 天的日均变化率&quot;，一个稳健的形式是 Theil–Sen 估计量——取所有点对的斜率中位数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">median</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta} = \\operatorname{median}\\left\\{\\frac{P_j - P_i}{t_j - t_i}\\right\\}_{i&lt;j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6079em;vertical-align:-1.1579em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">median</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.5601em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6782em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1579em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它对离群点不敏感（因为是中位数而非均值），在价格序列里比 OLS 更稳。缺点是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，所以实践上先对 segment 代表点做降采样再计算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"变点-趋势发生变化的那一刻\">变点：趋势发生变化的那一刻</h3><p>比&quot;当前斜率&quot;更有价值的是&quot;什么时候开始降价的&quot;。变点检测用于定位均值或斜率发生结构性变化的时刻。轻量的做法是在滑动窗口上做两段均值差的 CUSUM 检验；重一些的做法是用贝叶斯变点模型给出后验分布。工程上要的是<strong>可解释与可控延迟</strong>：变点必须在发生后数小时内报出，且有明确的置信分，因为它是 <a href=\"price-intel-dashboard\">竞争力情报看板</a> 上&quot;价格战预警&quot;的触发源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"促销事件的识别与剥离\">促销事件的识别与剥离</h3><p>把 <code>promo_state=&#39;promo&#39;</code> 的 segment 标为事件，但很多站点不暴露促销元数据，所以还需要形态判据：<strong>持续时长显著短于常规段（如 &lt; 72 小时）且价格低于基线中位数一定幅度</strong>的段，判定为事件段。剥离后的基线序列用于趋势与统计。这一步的位置很关键——它必须发生在趋势估计之前，否则一次为期三天的深促会把 30 天趋势斜率整体拉负，让系统误以为对手在持续降价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时序存储与聚合\">时序存储与聚合</h2><h3 id=\"存储形态选择\">存储形态选择</h3><p>价格时序是&quot;写多读多、按 offer 与时间范围查询、需要预聚合&quot;的典型负载。三种存储形态各有适用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储形态</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分区关系表（按月/周分区）</td>\n<td>中小规模</td>\n<td>事务与 SQL 完备</td>\n<td>需手工管理分区与索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列式时序表引擎</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n<td>高压缩、预聚合</td>\n<td>模型受限、写入语义特殊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物化视图/汇总表</td>\n<td>任意（配合上两者）</td>\n<td>读放大被摊平</td>\n<td>需刷新策略与一致性处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关系库里最省事的做法是按月对价格表做声明式分区，PostgreSQL 支持 range/list/hash 三种分区方式与分区裁剪（partition pruning），裁剪基于分区边界而非索引，能在计划期与执行期两个阶段剔除无关分区（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-partitioning.html\">PostgreSQL 18 §5.12 Table Partitioning</a>）。价格表按 <code>observed_at</code> 做月分区的好处很直接：删除过期数据变成 <code>DROP TABLE</code>，而不是代价高昂、还要 <code>VACUUM</code> 的批量 <code>DELETE</code>。</p>\n<p>大规模场景可用列式引擎做预聚合。以 <code>AggregatingMergeTree</code> 为例，它让同排序键的行在合并时折叠，行内保存的是聚合函数的状态而不是终值；写入用 <code>-State</code> 函数（如 <code>sumState</code>）产生状态，读取用对应 <code>-Merge</code> 函数（如 <code>sumMerge</code>）配合 <code>GROUP BY</code> 取得结果，典型用法是挂在物化视图之后维护&quot;访客总数、独立用户数&quot;这类随事件到达而更新的指标（<a href=\"https://clickhouse.com/docs/en/engines/table-engines/mergetree-family/aggregatingmergetree\">AggregatingMergeTree</a>）。价格情报里的对应物是&quot;每个 offer 每日的最低/最高/中位到手价&quot;这类日粒度汇总。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 声明式分区（PostgreSQL），按月切分价格明细&#10;CREATE TABLE price_point (&#10;  offer_id    bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  observed_at timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  landed      numeric(12,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  unit_price  numeric(14,6),&#10;  promo_state text        NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (offer_id, observed_at)&#10;) PARTITION BY RANGE (observed_at);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE price_point_2026m09 PARTITION OF price_point&#10;  FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2026-09-01&#39;) TO (&#39;2026-10-01&#39;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX ON price_point (offer_id, observed_at DESC);&#10;&#10;-- 日粒度汇总：下游看板与趋势估计都读它，避免反复扫明细&#10;CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW price_daily AS&#10;SELECT offer_id,&#10;       date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, observed_at) AS d,&#10;       min(landed)  AS min_landed,&#10;       max(landed)  AS max_landed,&#10;       percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY landed) AS p50_landed,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE promo_state = &#39;regular&#39;) AS regular_obs,&#10;       count(*) AS total_obs&#10;FROM   price_point&#10;GROUP  BY offer_id, date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, observed_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 声明式分区（PostgreSQL），按月切分价格明细</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> price_point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  offer_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  landed      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unit_price  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  promo_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (offer_id, observed_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RANGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (observed_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> price_point_2026m09</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF price_point</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-09-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-10-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_point (offer_id, observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 日粒度汇总：下游看板与趋势估计都读它，避免反复扫明细</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MATERIALIZED VIEW price_daily </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, observed_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(landed)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_landed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(landed)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_landed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> landed) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p50_landed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promo_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'regular'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> regular_obs,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_obs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   price_point</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP  BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_id, date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, observed_at);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"采样密度的置信加权\">采样密度的置信加权</h3><p>不是每个时间窗口都有足够观测。趋势与统计量必须带一个<strong>置信权重</strong>：窗口内有效观测数低于阈值（如 5）时不输出趋势结论，只输出&quot;数据不足&quot;。这与 <a href=\"../competitor-product-match/competitor-catalog-normalize\">竞品目录归一与置信度</a> 的组置信度是同一套哲学——<strong>任何进入自动决策的数字都必须带一个可信度</strong>，下游按可信度分级使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从时序派生出的价格特征\">从时序派生出的价格特征</h2><p>时序的价值在于它派生出的特征。至少要产出下面几组：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>服务对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>价格位置</td>\n<td>我方价在竞品组 30 天分布中的分位</td>\n<td>竞争力看板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波动率</td>\n<td>基线序列的日变化标准差</td>\n<td>规则引擎的稳定性判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更频率</td>\n<td>单位时间改价次数</td>\n<td>对手行为画像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促销深度/频次</td>\n<td>事件段相对基线的折让与出现频率</td>\n<td>价格战预警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地板价</td>\n<td>30/90 天最低常规价</td>\n<td>跟价护栏的下界参考</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中&quot;地板价&quot;是护栏最常用的输入：它回答&quot;对手过去最狠能到多少&quot;，比&quot;对手现在多少&quot;更能界定安全区间。注意地板价必须用<strong>常规价</strong>而非含促销的最低价，否则一次闪促会把护栏下界永久拉低。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;feature_set&quot;: &quot;price-ts-features-v2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;windows&quot;: { &quot;short&quot;: &quot;7d&quot;, &quot;mid&quot;: &quot;30d&quot;, &quot;long&quot;: &quot;90d&quot; },&#10;  &quot;min_obs_for_conclusion&quot;: 5,&#10;  &quot;features&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;price_percentile&quot;: { &quot;against&quot;: &quot;group_30d_distribution&quot;, &quot;method&quot;: &quot;empirical&quot; },&#10;    &quot;volatility&quot;: { &quot;stat&quot;: &quot;std&quot;, &quot;series&quot;: &quot;regular_only&quot;, &quot;freq&quot;: &quot;1d&quot; },&#10;    &quot;change_freq&quot;: { &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;per_week&quot;, &quot;dedupe_within_s&quot;: 900 },&#10;    &quot;floor_price&quot;: { &quot;stat&quot;: &quot;min&quot;, &quot;series&quot;: &quot;regular_only&quot;, &quot;window&quot;: &quot;90d&quot; },&#10;    &quot;trend_slope&quot;: { &quot;estimator&quot;: &quot;theil_sen&quot;, &quot;series&quot;: &quot;regular_only&quot;, &quot;window&quot;: &quot;30d&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;promo_stripping&quot;: { &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;duration&lt;72h AND landed&lt;p50*0.9&quot; },&#10;  &quot;missing_data_policy&quot;: &quot;no_conclusion_below_min_obs&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"feature_set\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price-ts-features-v2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"windows\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"short\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"long\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"90d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"min_obs_for_conclusion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"features\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"price_percentile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"against\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"group_30d_distribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"empirical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"volatility\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"stat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"series\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"regular_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"freq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"change_freq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per_week\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dedupe_within_s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"floor_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"stat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"series\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"regular_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"90d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"trend_slope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"estimator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"theil_sen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"series\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"regular_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"promo_stripping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"duration&#x3C;72h AND landed&#x3C;p50*0.9\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"missing_data_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no_conclusion_below_min_obs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与下游的接口\">与下游的接口</h2><p>时序层的两个产出——<code>price_daily</code> 汇总与 <code>price-ts-features-v2</code> 特征集——分别服务 <a href=\"price-intel-dashboard\">竞争力情报看板</a> 的分布与排名，以及 <a href=\"../repricing-rule-engine/repricing-rule-guardrail\">跟价规则与利润/品牌价护栏</a> 的目标价计算。规则引擎引用 <code>floor_price</code> 与 <code>volatility</code> 时的口径必须与本文一致（都是常规价序列），任何口径变更都要走版本号并同步更新规则配置，否则会出现&quot;规则按旧口径、数据按新口径&quot;的静默错位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>竞品价格序列由采集调度决定采样节奏，必须区分 <code>observed_at</code> 与推断的 <code>effective_at</code>，且&quot;没采到&quot;不等于&quot;没变化&quot;。</li>\n<li>先会话化：把连续同价合并成 segment，记录 <code>n_obs</code> 与 <code>duration_s</code> 作为证据强度；比较价格用最小货币单位或容差，避免浮点误判造成的假变更。</li>\n<li>趋势用对离群稳健的 Theil–Sen 斜率；变点检测用于定位降价起点并驱动价格战预警；促销必须<strong>在趋势估计之前</strong>剥离，否则短期深促会污染长期斜率。</li>\n<li>存储按 <code>observed_at</code> 月分区（PostgreSQL 分区裁剪基于边界而非索引），过期数据用 <code>DROP TABLE</code> 清理；大规模可用 AggregatingMergeTree 的 <code>-State</code>/<code>-Merge</code> 做预聚合。</li>\n<li>稀疏窗口不输出趋势结论，只输出&quot;数据不足&quot;；每个派生数字都带置信权重。</li>\n<li>派生特征至少含价格位置、波动率、变更频率、促销深度/频次与地板价；地板价必须基于常规价序列，否则闪促会永久压低护栏下界。</li>\n<li>特征与汇总是规则引擎与看板的唯一输入口径，口径变更必须走版本号并与规则配置同步。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"竞品价格时序与趋势","id":"竞品价格时序与趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"会话化：把散点压成变更记录","id":"会话化-把散点压成变更记录"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么先会话化","id":"为什么先会话化"},{"level":3,"text":"变更点与浮点陷阱","id":"变更点与浮点陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"趋势估计","id":"趋势估计"},{"level":3,"text":"在不均匀采样下的斜率","id":"在不均匀采样下的斜率"},{"level":3,"text":"变点：趋势发生变化的那一刻","id":"变点-趋势发生变化的那一刻"},{"level":3,"text":"促销事件的识别与剥离","id":"促销事件的识别与剥离"},{"level":2,"text":"时序存储与聚合","id":"时序存储与聚合"},{"level":3,"text":"存储形态选择","id":"存储形态选择"},{"level":3,"text":"采样密度的置信加权","id":"采样密度的置信加权"},{"level":2,"text":"从时序派生出的价格特征","id":"从时序派生出的价格特征"},{"level":2,"text":"与下游的接口","id":"与下游的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"价格清洗与异常/运费陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/price-intelligence-data/price-cleanse-anomaly"},"next":{"title":"竞争力情报看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/price-intelligence-data/price-intel-dashboard"}}